%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a265629390da5d048b9048e88bfa94cb, type: 3}
  m_Name: Act1Scene4.3 ALT
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allLines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "Ah, I\u2019m back! Thank you!\r"
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Good thing you were able to understand what to do through that page.
      I was lucky enough to get it here before I lost control.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "I think I\u2019m due some answers here.\r\r"
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "Yes, of course. My name is Antonio. I was the previous jester at this
      circus.\r\r\r"
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "It was like a home to me\u2026 And it is also my grave."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: You died here? Sorry to hear that.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "Yes, it was unfortunate. My magic wasn\u2019t even enough to save
      me."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Wait, do you mean actual magic??
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "Yes, I was a magician, a real one. That\u2019s why the mask I gave
      you has special powers."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "I\u2019m sorry, this is a lot to take in\u2026"
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: Well we can talk more later, but I need to figure out how to help the
      others.
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "There are other ghosts here? Maybe I can help out! I\u2019m clearly
      a professional ghost helper after all."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "The longer a ghost is gone, the less of them remain. I\u2019m not
      sure if you\u2019d be up to the task."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87aeb4586b2c7154a8ad18806dcc400e, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "You don\u2019t have to worry about me, I can take care of myself.
      I just want to help if I can."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: "I guess you aren\u2019t going to take no for an answer\u2026 Alright,
      we can help them together."
    dialogueOptions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a03a42448b39ea94a8d4dbe68b31d1b7, type: 2}
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: But before we leave, allow me to attach myself to the mask so I can
      guide you along the way.
    dialogueOptions: []
